    <string name="about_application_title">Isicelo</string>
    <string name="about_description">I-Svitlo sisicelo sokujonga amashedyuli okucima kombane e-Ukraine. Gcina ikhaya, indawo yomsebenzi neminye imiqondiso ebalulekileyo ukuze ubone ishedyuli yanamhlanje nengomso kwaye uceboe usuku lwakho.</string>
    <string name="about_how_it_works_title">Isebenza njani</string>
    <string name="about_how_it_works_body">Yongeza indawo: khetha ingingqi, umboneleli wombane neqela lokucima kombane. Misela igama lakho nesithonjana. Kwisikrini esikhulu kuza kuvela ishedyuli enamanqanaba esiqingatha seyure, uphawu lwexesha langoku nexesha lokuhlaziywa kwedatha. Onke amashedyuli abonisa ixesha laseKyiv.</string>
    <string name="about_reminders_title">Izikhumbuzo</string>
    <string name="about_reminders_body">Kwindawo nganye ungakhetha ukuba isikhumbuzo sithunyelwe imizuzu emingaphi ngaphambi kokucima. Imo ethi “Ungandiphazamisi ebusuku” iyazicima ukusuka ku-23:00 ukuya ku-07:00. Vumela izaziso kwizicwangciso ze-Android. Ixesha lokuhanjiswa lixhomekeke kwimvume yenkqubo nakwimida yesixhobo.</string>
    <string name="about_widget_title">Iwijethi nokufikelela ngaphandle kwe-intanethi</string>
    <string name="about_widget_body">Yongeza iwijethi kwiscreen sasekhaya ukuze ubone ishedyuli ungayivulanga into yokusebenza kwaye utshintshe phakathi kwanamhlanje nengomso. Amashedyuli alayishiweyo agcinwa kwisixhobo kwaye afumaneka ngaphandle kwe-intanethi. Ukufumana idatha entsha kufuneka unxibelelwano lwenethiwekhi.</string>
    <string name="about_sources_title">Imithombo yedatha</string>
    <string name="about_sources_body">Isicelo silayisha amashedyuli apapashiweyo kwi-YASNO API nakwimigcini evulekileyo yedatha yokucima kombane. Ishedyuli yengomso iyavela emva kokupapashwa ngumthombo. Ukuhlaziywa kwedatha kuxhomekeke kwimithombo; idatha egciniweyo isenokuba byatha. Ngexesha lokucima kwexesha lokuxhalaba, unikezelo lombane lokwenene lusenokwahluka kwishedyuli.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_title">Ubumfihlo</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">Iindawo ezigciniweyo nezicwangciso zigcinwa kwisixhobo ngokwaso. Isicelo sisebenzisa i-Firebase ukuhlalutya ukusetyenziswa, iingxelo zokuphazamiseka nezaziso zenkonzo. Amagama eendawo ezigciniweyo awongezwa kwiziganeko zohlalutyo nakwiingxelo zokuphazamiseka.</string>
